body:
@Correctover 

This issue is not for what you are depicting. It is for "same model, different provider" which is completely different from what you're stating.

Here, the only caveat should be "cache misses" due to provider change, not differences on "intelligence". if the underlying model id changes from provider to provider, i.e, quantization or so, I don't think that's something that should be taken into account here
